  "gaps": [
    "Catalog year/term is not stated on the page.",
    "The course list is headed 'Requirements (36 credit hours)' but also lists MHRC 476 (4 credits) before the track choice, and the summary shows 40 Major Requirements Credits; the ledger treats the 36 credits of listed courses plus the 4-credit final track (Track 1: MHRC 476; or Track 2: MHRC 470 at 3 credits + MHRC 475 at 1 credit) as the 40 major credits. This needs to be confirmed against the academic catalog.",
    "The Kirkpatrick Signature Series is required 'In addition to the major requirements', but its courses, credit amount, and whether it counts within the 37 general education credits are not stated.",
    "The specific general education courses and distribution requirements within the 37 Integrative General Education credits are not listed.",
    "Residency requirements (credits that must be completed at Bellevue University) are not stated.",
    "Upper-division credit minimums, minimum grade or GPA requirements, and other graduation policies are not stated; the page says to consult an admissions counselor to verify minimum graduation requirements.",
    "Admission requires 60 transfer credits and current or past relevant employment; how those 60 credits map onto the general education and elective blocks is not stated."
